<title>USA: GE CEO Welch's 96 pay was $6.3 mln - NYT.</title>
<headline>GE CEO Welch's 96 pay was $6.3 mln - NYT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Welch Jr, the chairman and chief executive of General Electric, earned $6.3 million in salary and bonus in 1996, the New York Times said Thursday.</p>
<p>The paper said the sum is an 18.4 percent increase over Welch's 1995 pay.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
